Package: libltdl3
Version: 1.5.6-r1
Description: Generic library support script This is GNU libtool, a generic library support script.  Libtool hides the complexity of generating special library types (such as shared libraries) behind a consistent interface.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: ftp://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/libtool/libtool-1.5.6.tar.gz            file://autotools.patch;patch=1
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1)
